        "text": "work (done) = force $\\times$ displacement"
      },
      {
        "mark": "B1",
        "text": "(force = $mg$ and distance = $\\Delta h$) (so) work (done) = $mg\\Delta h$ and work = $\\Delta E_{(P)}$ (so $\\Delta E_{(P)} = mg\\Delta h$)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "9702_s22_23_q04_b": {
    "points": [
      {
        "mark": "B1",
        "text": "gravitational potential (energy) to heat / thermal (energy)"
      }
    ]
  },
